        {
            "_id": "FH3YXlwcFus2BEDY",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Alchemical Chambers",
            "sort": 200000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A noxious needler's body contains six alchemical chambers filled with different substances. When a noxious needler's ability calls upon a randomly determined alchemical effect, roll 1d6 and consult the following (if you roll the result of a chamber that was shattered, there is no alchemical effect):</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th><p>[[/gmr 1d6 #Alchemical Chambers]]</p></th><th><p>Alchemical Effect</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Acid Damage</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Cold Damage</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Electricity Damage</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Fire Damage</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Poison Damage</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>Sickness: @Check[fortitude|dc:38|options:inflicts:sickened] save or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure)</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "ORC",
                    "remaster": true,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": []
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "mtaGhsCNNiwCxCLf",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Alchemical Rupture",
            "sort": 300000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>When a noxious needler takes physical damage from a critical hit or is affected by a shatter spell, one glass chamber within its body shatters, spewing alchemical liquid in a @Template[emanation|distance:10]. Roll on the alchemical chambers list to determine which one shatters—on a roll of 1–5, creatures in the area take 15d6 damage of the appropriate type (DC 40 basic Reflex). On a roll of 6, creatures must instead save against the sickness effect.</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th><p>[[/gmr 1d6 #Alchemical Rupture]]</p></th><th><p>Alchemical Effect</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>@Damage[15d6[acid]|options:area-damage] damage @Check[reflex|dc:40|basic|options:area-effect|traits:acid]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>@Damage[15d6[cold]|options:area-damage] damage @Check[reflex|dc:40|basic|options:area-effect|traits:cold]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>@Damage[15d6[electricity]|options:area-damage] damage @Check[reflex|dc:40|basic|options:area-effect|traits:electricity]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>@Damage[15d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage @Check[reflex|dc:40|basic|options:area-effect|traits:fire]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>@Damage[15d6[poison]|options:area-damage] damage @Check[reflex|dc:40|basic|options:area-effect|traits:poison]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>Sickness: @Check[fortitude|dc:40|options:area-effect,inflicts:sickened] save or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure)</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "ORC",
                    "remaster": true,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
